          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "റിസർവേഷൻ — ṟisarvēṣan — \"a reservation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "റിസർവേഷൻ ഇല്ലെങ്കിൽ സീറ്റ് കിട്ടില്ല. ṟisarvēṣan illeṅkil sīṟṟŭ kiṭṭilla. If you have no reservation, you won't get a seat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A reserved seat on a train is a റിസർവേഷൻ (ṟisarvēṣan) സീറ്റ്."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "റിസർവേഷൻ (ṟisarvēṣan) was borrowed from English reservation, a seat or room kept for someone in advance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
